Using the notation above, the following holds:

-
the left action of $(\k^\ast)^n$ on $\widehat{R^\circ}$ is faithful;

- the morphism $\epsilon  \, : \Z^n \longrightarrow (\k^\ast)^n$ is injective if and only if $\bar{q}$ is generic;

- the left action of $\Z^n$ on $\widehat{R^\circ}$ is faithful if and only if
$\bar{q}$ is generic.
